+	 * Feed the watchdog through the whole of early board_r.  The first
+	 * WATCHDOG_RESET() below sits after initr_dm, board_init,
+	 * initr_dm_devices and serial_initialize - on a slow board that whole
+	 * device-probing stretch can outlast a short hardware period, and a
+	 * healthy board then resets before it ever prints "Now running in RAM".
